                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There is a saying that if you are going to do something the same as others, you either need to do it better or do it in a different way... this game achieves neither. Very few landscapes, no defined themes, stock looking assets, wonky physics, no online community, and generic music make this game something I simply can't recommend when there is a game that is cheaper and better. Go play Golf With Your Friends instead.\nVideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=psR3HJ4y0yg&t=",
